  "scope": "Local pulse, marking, and unbounded unary-register increment/decrement contracts on the exact Routing245 table, preserving arbitrary values and whole-tape context. Zero decrement retains a following-block premise; increment appends one value-one spare. No all-sites, full binary runtime, blank bootstrap, consistency, or PA endpoint.",
  "replay": "Original guards are provenance, not a portable runner. Reusing their exact execution requires the historical layout and exact recorded dependency/compiler objects. Maintained Lean sources may be built with ordinary imports, which would be a new build. No clean-checkout replay is claimed.",
